# ── Auth Tests ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Click "Send Request" above each ### block to run it

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Yousif",
  "email": "yousif@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "+973 3300 0000"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "yousif@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Try a protected route WITHOUT token (expect 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/summary

### Try a protected route WITH token (paste your token below, expect 404 not 403)
